# Source PNGs for the three class hero images, superseded by the .webp beside
# them. 6.97MB -> 422KB (93% smaller) with no visible quality loss, and these
# load on the home screen and the app-shell background, so it came straight off
# every player's first paint. Kept on disk as the masters to re-export from.
apps/web/public/characters/Berserkers.png
apps/web/public/characters/Sentinel.png
apps/web/public/characters/Phanthom.png

# ── Private docs: kept locally, deliberately not published ───────────────────
# Untracked 2026-08-03. These stay on disk and out of the repository.
#
# Grant and strategy material. GRANT_EVIDENCE.md in particular contains candid
# internal assessments ("THIS IS WRONG" against a milestone marked complete),
# written as honest bookkeeping but readable by a grant committee as coaching on
# how to present numbers. ONCHAIN_TRANSACTIONS.md describes where new on-chain
# volume could come from "for grant reporting", which reads as gaming the metric
# whatever the intent was.
docs/GRANT_EVIDENCE.md
docs/ONCHAIN_TRANSACTIONS.md
docs/LITEPAPER.md
docs/EDITIONS_ROADMAP.md
docs/C5_SHIP_GATE.md
docs/B0_ECONOMY_DEPLOY.md

