docs/CAPACITOR.md
docs/RAILWAY_MIGRATION.md

# 60 players' wallet addresses and balances. All of it is derivable from chain,
# but a curated list of a game's players is a different thing from data being
# public on an explorer. Regenerate it from Transfer events when MigrateScrip
# needs it — which is what the script's header tells you to do anyway, because a
# stale list short-changes real players.
contracts/scrip-holders.json
